  ('taking-real-breaks-at-work', 199, 'Tell a coworker one thing you appreciate about them during your break today.'),
  ('taking-real-breaks-at-work', 200, 'At the end of your shift, look over this challenge so far and pick the break habit that has helped you most.'),
  ('taking-real-breaks-at-work', 201, 'Notice the smell, color and warmth of your lunch before you take your first bite.'),
  ('taking-real-breaks-at-work', 202, 'If you stand most of your shift, flex and point your feet ten times during a quiet moment.'),
